## Description

Introducing OpenDreamer, an open reproduction of Dreamer4.  We supported @FrancescoSacco1, @martidiegom, and @edward_s_hu to build a frontier-level world model, and we've open-sourced everything: the model, the training code, and every hard-won lesson from building it. https://t.co/4KbhrbP52x

